9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/is52qno4p40b44u0k5iwcqcmrrtam9l.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%98%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1c/is52qno4p40b44u0k5iwcqcmrrtam9l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />冰原生存法则\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳跃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳跃</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"攀爬\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">攀爬</font></span></span>]，无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"高级无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">高级无视守护</font></span></span>]效果。<br />\n✦战斗开始时，在正前方放置1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"呆呆雪人\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">呆呆雪人</font></span></span>]，随后雪人在其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内随机位置，生成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"苔原蜜果\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">苔原蜜果</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"碎冰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">碎冰</font></span></span>]各<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个。<br />✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">嘿咻！</font></span>]。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B9%8C%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/乌莉娅\"><img alt=\"头像 乌莉娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d3/4gxudq77xnlntmitcbxzlqhka07e7uf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">乌莉娅</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳跃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳跃</font><